WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:07.833
- Made it.
- Hey Bonnie, slow it down.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.800
- You could hurt yourself.
- I'm fine. I'm fine.

3
00:00:10.866 --> 00:00:14.500
- Look at these decorations.
- Maybe it's a festival.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.066
Hurry up, come on.

5
00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:21.566
They sure are in a hurry.

6
00:00:24.633 --> 00:00:27.400
- Hi!
- Anybody here?

7
00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:31.233
Hello and welcome to the Pokémon Centre!

8
00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.633
-What can I do for you?

9
00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.666
Oh, of course. You must be new here.

10
00:00:37.733 --> 00:00:41.066
You've arrived right in the middle of our Gourgeist Festival.

11
00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:43.566
- Gourgeist Festival?
- That's right.

12
00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:45.833
All the townsfolk simply adore it.

13
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.700
See? Everyone likes to dress up in costumes.

14
00:00:48.766 --> 00:00:51.433
- Wigglytuff.
- Whee, that sounds like fun.

15
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.433
That's what those kids were doing.

16
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.833
Do you think maybe we could join in too?

17
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.466
- Please do!
- Awesome, let's all do it!

18
00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:00.500
What do you think we should dress up as?

19
00:01:00.566 --> 00:01:03.166
You just leave that to me.

20
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.766
- Chespin, che!
- Chespin, you look great.

21
00:01:09.833 --> 00:01:12.433
Ludcolo! Yay!

22
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.366
- Denne-ne!
- Wow, you look so cute as a Corphish.

23
00:01:15.433 --> 00:01:18.466
Ta-da! I'm a Florges!

24
00:01:20.866 --> 00:01:22.533
Pika.

25
00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.400
If you're not holding your ears down, you won't look as much like a Psyduck.

26
00:01:26.466 --> 00:01:28.033
Pi. Pika!

27
00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:31.100
Yes! Everybody ready for the Gourgeist Festival?

28
00:01:31.166 --> 00:01:33.933
- Yeah!
- Pika!

29
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

30
00:01:35.866 --> 00:01:37.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

31
00:01:37.633 --> 00:01:41.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

32
00:01:41.066 --> 00:01:42.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

33
00:01:42.533 --> 00:01:46.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

34
00:01:46.366 --> 00:01:49.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

35
00:01:49.633 --> 00:01:53.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

36
00:01:53.066 --> 00:01:56.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

37
00:01:57.033 --> 00:02:01.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

38
00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

39
00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:13.000
- A Festival Trade!
- A Festival Farewell?

40
00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:17.233
Our heroes continue on their way to Anistar City,

41
00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:20.733
where Ash will battle for his seventh Kalos Gym Badge.

42
00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:24.000
- Wow.
- So pretty!

43
00:02:24.066 --> 00:02:27.100
- Hi, here you go!

44
00:02:27.166 --> 00:02:28.300
What's this?

45
00:02:28.366 --> 00:02:31.300
Oh, see, here in the Gourgeist Festival...

46
00:02:31.366 --> 00:02:33.900
We all trade yummy treats with one another.

47
00:02:33.966 --> 00:02:36.100
So it's more than costumes.

48
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:38.300
Wow. Well, in that case,

49
00:02:38.366 --> 00:02:39.900
- here, for you!
- Aah!

50
00:02:39.966 --> 00:02:41.700
Thank you!

51
00:02:41.766 --> 00:02:43.966
I brought plenty for everyone.

52
00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:47.966
- Yeah, then let's trade a whole lot.
- Pikachu!

53
00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:51.900
- Oh, boy! Let's see how much we can trade!
- Denne-ne!

54
00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.600
Pikachu's here too.

55
00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.733
It's almost like they created this festival just for us.

56
00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:03.266
This Banette... Yeah, this Banette costume rocks.

57
00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:06.633
The only problem is it's hard to talk with the zipper zipped.

58
00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:08.600
- Wobba, Wobbuffet.
- Inkay.

59
00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:11.366
Dressin' up like Pikachu is your thing.

60
00:03:11.433 --> 00:03:14.366
Wearing that costume a second time signals a trend.

61
00:03:14.433 --> 00:03:15.466
Kay, Inkay!

62
00:03:15.533 --> 00:03:19.566
All right, let's seize the moment and grab Pikachu once and for all.

63
00:03:19.633 --> 00:03:22.633
- Yes, let's!
- Wobbuffet.

64
00:03:25.166 --> 00:03:27.066
Excellent! Heh.

65
00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:30.733
- A truly remarkable Pumpkaboo.
- Pumpka!

66
00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:34.000
Here. Take a look at this, Prince Pumpkaboo.

67
00:03:34.066 --> 00:03:35.500
Kaboo!

68
00:03:35.566 --> 00:03:38.533
- Do you like what you see?
- Boo!

69
00:03:46.266 --> 00:03:49.633
First off, when do you think we should strike?

70
00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:52.400
Gourgeist. Gourgeist!

71
00:03:52.466 --> 00:03:54.833
- Who are they?
- Don't look at me!

72
00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.566
- Pokémon perhaps?
- Gourgeist. Gour, Gourgeist!

73
00:03:57.633 --> 00:04:00.300
Who or what are you? We don't have any treats.

74
00:04:00.366 --> 00:04:02.133
Gourgeist, that's enough.

75
00:04:04.266 --> 00:04:07.666
I'm so very sorry if we frightened you.

76
00:04:07.733 --> 00:04:10.866
I'm the steward of that castle you see there.

77
00:04:10.933 --> 00:04:12.500
I'm here on behalf of the count,

78
00:04:12.566 --> 00:04:15.600
who, as lord of the castle, would like you to pay him a visit.

79
00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:18.066
- You're kidding, right?
- Oh, no.

80
00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:20.633
We've a fine dinner waiting as well.

81
00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:24.033
It might be more fun to grab Pikachu after a good meal.

82
00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.466
Right with you.

83
00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.100
We'd love to take you up on your offer.

84
00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:46.133
I'm sorry for the short notice. Count Pumpka's the name.

85
00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:50.033
- I trust our sudden invitation was fine?
- Lovely!

86
00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:53.133
I've asked you all here for a single, simple reason.

87
00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:56.133
I have something to discuss regarding your Pumpkaboo.

88
00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:59.733
- My Pumpkaboo?
- It's a very rare Pumpkaboo indeed.

89
00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:02.400
Why, I've never seen one so large before.

90
00:05:03.300 --> 00:05:06.266
- We've got a rare Pumpkaboo?
- I'll do research.

91
00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:08.766
Pumpkaboo come in all different sizes.

92
00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:11.266
Apparently, yours is the super-sized one.

93
00:05:11.333 --> 00:05:12.700
That's news to me.

94
00:05:12.766 --> 00:05:18.333
Actually, my prince laid its royal eyes on your Pumpkaboo first.

95
00:05:19.566 --> 00:05:21.366
Pum?

96
00:05:21.433 --> 00:05:22.833
Kaboo!

97
00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:25.633
- The prince would like to become friends.
- Friends?

98
00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:28.466
- Don't tell me you're a girl.
- Kaboo-boo.

99
00:05:28.533 --> 00:05:29.933
You didn't know that?

100
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.233
No. So sue me. Huh?

101
00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:37.000
It seems to me we're holding all of the cards, right?

102
00:05:37.066 --> 00:05:40.300
- We've got the advantage, too.
- Let's make good use of it.

103
00:05:40.366 --> 00:05:43.066
- Good meaning what?
- My dear count.

104
00:05:43.133 --> 00:05:46.033
I have a teensy-weensy favour to ask of you.

105
00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:49.833
Our Pumpkaboo is being chased by a group of very bad people.

106
00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:53.466
Oh, my! Though it's so lovely, I'm not surprised.

107
00:05:53.533 --> 00:05:56.766
They're villains who enjoy stealing other people's Pokémon.

108
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:00.066
They've even stolen one of our favourite Pokémon already.

109
00:06:00.133 --> 00:06:03.833
- Dear. What Pokémon would that be?
- Pikachu!

110
00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:07.466
Pikachu?

111
00:06:07.533 --> 00:06:11.666
This is simply our Inkay dressed up as Pikachu.

112
00:06:11.733 --> 00:06:13.933
- Inkay!
- Now they're coming after my Pumpkaboo.

113
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.700
It's just wrong.

114
00:06:15.766 --> 00:06:19.933
Please, Count. Bring the hammer of justice down on their pointy, crooked heads.

115
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.800
Please help our little Pikachu to be returned to us.

116
00:06:22.866 --> 00:06:25.533
- And if you do, then perhaps...
- Kaboo!

117
00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.900
Just perhaps.

118
00:06:27.966 --> 00:06:32.333
You're so right. Despicable criminals must be punished.

119
00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:34.900
Thank you. A royally wise choice.

120
00:06:34.966 --> 00:06:37.233
Say, that was sheer brilliance.

121
00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.166
Now we'll be able to steal Pikachu

122
00:06:39.233 --> 00:06:42.633
and enjoy a sumptuous meal, all at the very same time.

123
00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:45.400
- Multitasking. Yeah.
- Wobba.

124
00:06:45.466 --> 00:06:49.733
- Look at all I got.
- Now don't eat that all at once.

125
00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:51.733
Hey, I'm not dumb.

126
00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:56.466
-Gourgeist, Gourgeist.

127
00:06:56.533 --> 00:06:59.566
- Now who's that?
- Geist, geist, Gourgeist.

128
00:06:59.633 --> 00:07:03.733
Gourgeist. The Pumpkin Pokémon, and the evolved form of Pumpkaboo.

129
00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.033
Gourgeist wander through town at the new moon,

130
00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.900
surrounding their prey with their arms, which resemble hair.

131
00:07:08.966 --> 00:07:11.300
Gour, Gourgeist, geist.

132
00:07:11.366 --> 00:07:12.300
Who are you?

133
00:07:12.366 --> 00:07:16.533
I want you to hand over that Pikachu peacefully, you criminals.

134
00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.766
- Pikachu?
- What do you mean?

135
00:07:18.833 --> 00:07:21.300
- Gourgeist, Shadow Ball!
- Gourgeist!

136
00:07:21.366 --> 00:07:23.533
-Pika!

137
00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.733
- Hey, cut it out!
- This has to be a misunderstanding!

138
00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.200
Gour, Gourgeist!

139
00:07:30.266 --> 00:07:33.433
- Iron Tail!
- Pikachu! Ah, Pika!

140
00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:37.700
- Pi!
- Now, Bunnelby, Dig!

141
00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:42.500
Bunnel...by!

142
00:07:42.566 --> 00:07:43.700
Gour!

143
00:07:43.766 --> 00:07:45.400
Bunnelby, Mud Shot!

144
00:07:45.466 --> 00:07:47.633
- Bunnelby!
- Gour!

145
00:07:47.700 --> 00:07:50.433
All right, Pancham, go!

146
00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.766
Use Stone Edge!

147
00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:54.500
Pancham!

148
00:07:54.566 --> 00:07:55.633
Gourgeist!

149
00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.100
- Shadow Ball, now.
- Gour.

150
00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:01.133
Pika? Pika!

151
00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:03.033
Gourgeist!

152
00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:04.666
- Pan!
- Bunnel...

153
00:08:04.733 --> 00:08:06.266
- Pancham, no!
- Bunnelby!

154
00:08:06.333 --> 00:08:08.666
Go-go-go-go-go-go-go-go-gour!

155
00:08:10.466 --> 00:08:13.066
Now we'll be taking that Pikachu back.

156
00:08:13.133 --> 00:08:17.600
What? No way! Pikachu's my... Hey, come back right now!

157
00:08:22.666 --> 00:08:25.300
- Ah! Pikachu.
- Pika, pika.

158
00:08:25.366 --> 00:08:26.366
Huh?

159
00:08:26.433 --> 00:08:27.866
-Pikachu?

160
00:08:27.933 --> 00:08:31.833
- But you heard what that man said.
- He said he was taking Pikachu back.

161
00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:32.900
Pika?

162
00:08:32.966 --> 00:08:36.100
- I'm glad you're all right.
- Bunnelby's OK too.

163
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:39.200
- Pancham too!
- But Chespin's gone!

164
00:08:39.266 --> 00:08:41.900
You don't think they could have stolen Chespin, do you?

165
00:08:44.666 --> 00:08:47.100
Pi. Pika?

166
00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:52.266
Here. Your Pikachu, ma'am.

167
00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:55.733
- Success. We caught Pikachu.
- Quiet down!

168
00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:58.866
We're so glad to have you back, Pikachu dear.

169
00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:04.833
Since I held up my end of the bargain, it is now your turn.

170
00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.966
So please, give me what you agreed to.

171
00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:15.466
- Fletchinder!
- Where's Chespin?

172
00:09:15.533 --> 00:09:19.000
- Fletch!
- In that castle up there? Right.

173
00:09:19.066 --> 00:09:22.000
We'll get you out of there, Chespin, promise.

174
00:09:22.066 --> 00:09:24.933
Who's that Pokémon?

175
00:09:29.066 --> 00:09:32.000
It's Gourgeist!

176
00:09:32.066 --> 00:09:34.933
Gourgeist!

177
00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:41.066
Now, if I may be so bold, there's something I'd like to discuss with you.

178
00:09:41.133 --> 00:09:43.200
- Pumpkaboo!
- Pumpka!

179
00:09:43.266 --> 00:09:44.600
- Pum?
- Kaboo!

180
00:09:44.666 --> 00:09:46.066
- Kaboo!
- Pum...

181
00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:49.300
I would like your Pumpkaboo to marry Prince Pumpkaboo

182
00:09:49.366 --> 00:09:51.733
and become Princess Pumpkaboo.

183
00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:54.966
- Why, of course
- Pumpkaboo!

184
00:09:55.033 --> 00:09:57.833
Great. We'll trade Pumpkaboo for Pikachu.

185
00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.066
Stop!

186
00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:04.266
- I want my Chespin back now!
- They're villains.

187
00:10:04.333 --> 00:10:06.333
- Is that so? You're criminals.
- Che!

188
00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:07.833
What are you talking about?

189
00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.333
Stop your whispering and give us back Chespin.

190
00:10:10.400 --> 00:10:11.400
What Chespin?

191
00:10:11.466 --> 00:10:12.733
- I don't understand.
- -Che! Che!

192
00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.266
I mean that Chespin. The one in the cage.

193
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:18.200
Chespin.

194
00:10:18.266 --> 00:10:21.100
- What is this?
- Chespin was in disguise all the time.

195
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:23.866
Steward!

196
00:10:23.933 --> 00:10:26.933
Count, I will retrieve Pikachu straight away.

197
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.566
Gourgeist!

198
00:10:31.033 --> 00:10:32.900
It's them again.

199
00:10:32.966 --> 00:10:35.400
- Pikachu, let's go!
- Pika, pika!

200
00:10:35.466 --> 00:10:37.366
Bunnelby, let's fix this!

201
00:10:37.433 --> 00:10:40.033
Right, Braixen, come out!

202
00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:41.300
- Bunnelby.
- Braixen.

203
00:10:41.366 --> 00:10:42.900
Gourgeist!

204
00:10:42.966 --> 00:10:45.066
Dodge and use Electro Ball!

205
00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:48.000
Chu! Ah, Pika!

206
00:10:49.566 --> 00:10:52.500
- Shadow Ball!
- Gourgeist!

207
00:10:52.566 --> 00:10:55.133
- Use Mud Shot!
- Bunnelby!

208
00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.200
Gour!

209
00:10:56.266 --> 00:10:59.100
- Gourgeist, use Shadow Ball now!
- Gourgeist!

210
00:10:59.166 --> 00:11:03.000
- Dodge, then Flamethrower!
- Braix, Braixen!

211
00:11:03.066 --> 00:11:04.400
Gourgeist!

212
00:11:04.466 --> 00:11:07.066
- This isn't over.
- Gourgeist!

213
00:11:07.133 --> 00:11:09.166
- Use Hidden Power!
- Braixen!

214
00:11:09.233 --> 00:11:11.500
- Quick, Thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

215
00:11:11.566 --> 00:11:13.166
- Bunnelby, Wild Charge!
- Bunn!

216
00:11:13.233 --> 00:11:17.133
Gourgeist, Gourgeist!

217
00:11:18.533 --> 00:11:21.366
Get Pikachu. What are you waiting for?

218
00:11:21.433 --> 00:11:23.200
- Now!
- Sir.

219
00:11:25.100 --> 00:11:27.533
Give me back my Chespin!

220
00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:28.666
-Pika!

221
00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:33.233
You villains will be quiet until our business is concluded.

222
00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.533
So now that Pikachu has been caught,

223
00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.000
let's continue what we were talking about.

224
00:11:39.066 --> 00:11:41.233
I don't remember.

225
00:11:44.566 --> 00:11:46.766
That's called a Pokémon Trade Machine.

226
00:11:46.833 --> 00:11:49.500
We will trade my Pokémon for your Pumpkaboo.

227
00:11:49.566 --> 00:11:53.400
- Trade for my Pumpkaboo?
- As you promised.

228
00:11:53.466 --> 00:11:56.966
Pumpkaboo and I have shared countless hours together.

229
00:11:57.033 --> 00:11:59.300
Memories, the good times and the bad.

230
00:11:59.366 --> 00:12:03.633
You don't just throw all of that away, you know. Aah!

231
00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:08.500
Now, look. Our friendship cannot be traded away.

232
00:12:08.566 --> 00:12:10.266
Pumpka!

233
00:12:10.333 --> 00:12:13.266
- Whoa.
- Wait a minute.

234
00:12:13.333 --> 00:12:16.000
I know that this cage has been electrified.

235
00:12:16.066 --> 00:12:20.866
- But if we can short it out...
- That's a great idea.

236
00:12:20.933 --> 00:12:25.233
After considering what you said...

237
00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.900
Then how about making a trade for this Mawile?

238
00:12:27.966 --> 00:12:29.066
Mawile!

239
00:12:29.133 --> 00:12:31.566
I wouldn't do that if you paid me.

240
00:12:31.633 --> 00:12:34.433
My Pumpkaboo and I are connected by our hearts.

241
00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.033
The bond between Pokémon and trainer is everlasting.

242
00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.500
Pumpkaboo!

243
00:12:38.566 --> 00:12:39.900
I think you should be aware

244
00:12:39.966 --> 00:12:43.500
Mawile is one of the few Pokémon who can Mega Evolve.

245
00:12:43.566 --> 00:12:47.033
Hm... Mega Evolve?

246
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:51.900
Mega Evolve! Step on it!

247
00:12:57.933 --> 00:13:02.333
Right, so let's make that trade.

248
00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:05.200
What about the bond between Pokémon and trainer?

249
00:13:05.266 --> 00:13:09.333
Mm... Kaboo! Kaboo.

250
00:13:12.766 --> 00:13:16.066
- Pumpkaboo, ka-kaboo.
- Boo.

251
00:13:16.133 --> 00:13:18.666
- Ooh.
- Pumpkaboo likes the prince too,

252
00:13:18.733 --> 00:13:22.300
and wants to stay here, so you should go ahead and make with that trade.

253
00:13:22.366 --> 00:13:24.366
- Ah!
- Oh, that's just wonderful.

254
00:13:24.433 --> 00:13:28.133
Of all the nerve. And after everything I've done for you.

255
00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.200
- Pumpkaboo! Kaboo!
- What?

256
00:13:30.266 --> 00:13:32.066
- Pumpka!
- Pumpkaboo!

257
00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:36.066
- You know, this is getting a tad ugly.
- And how.

258
00:13:36.133 --> 00:13:38.300
Fine with me. It's a deal.

259
00:13:38.366 --> 00:13:40.666
Pumpkaboo.

260
00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:47.200
- All right, then let's trade.
- Ready.

261
00:13:55.866 --> 00:13:58.100
Trade complete.

262
00:13:58.166 --> 00:14:00.866
Huh. Hm. Mm!

263
00:14:00.933 --> 00:14:03.866
Excellent! Now it's time.

264
00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:06.366
Pumpkaboo, come forth.

265
00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.033
Pumpkaboo!

266
00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.966
- Aah!
- Pumpka, pumpka!

267
00:14:11.033 --> 00:14:12.033
Pumpka?

268
00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.566
- Ooh.
- Huh?

269
00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.566
- Is that what I think?
- Pika?

270
00:14:18.633 --> 00:14:19.933
Maybe it's evolving.

271
00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.933
Pumpkaboo, you picked a fine time to do that.

272
00:14:28.466 --> 00:14:30.433
Gour, Gourgeist.

273
00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.266
- Pumpkaboo's a Gourgeist now.
- Ooh. Indeed.

274
00:14:33.333 --> 00:14:35.733
It must have undergone an Exchange Evolution.

275
00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:37.500
Hm?

276
00:14:38.033 --> 00:14:40.666
- Gourgeist. Gour.
- Pumpka! Ka!

277
00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.400
Pumpkaboo.

278
00:14:44.466 --> 00:14:49.400
This is awful. The prince preferred Pumpkaboo before it evolved.

279
00:14:49.466 --> 00:14:52.133
What did you say?

280
00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.100
This is no joke. You said that we'd trade,

281
00:14:55.166 --> 00:14:56.933
so I did it in spite of my pain.

282
00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.433
In fact, you really couldn't wait.

283
00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:03.100
Just because it evolved, you want to call it off? Now, please.

284
00:15:03.166 --> 00:15:05.500
- True, true.
- Wobbuffet.

285
00:15:05.566 --> 00:15:08.566
But I can dig how Prince Pumpkaboo feels.

286
00:15:08.633 --> 00:15:11.500
The very same thing happened to me back in the day.

287
00:15:11.566 --> 00:15:14.600
Ahoy. Now hear this, little prince.

288
00:15:14.666 --> 00:15:19.366
Do you have any idea how wonderful my Pumpkaboo has been?

289
00:15:19.433 --> 00:15:22.133
I remember when I was burning up with a fever.

290
00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:25.666
Pumpkaboo took care of me the whole night through.

291
00:15:27.166 --> 00:15:30.100
-Pumpka!

292
00:15:30.166 --> 00:15:33.633
Ah! Grating berries and then spoon-feeding them to me.

293
00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:35.200
Pumpkaboo.

294
00:15:35.266 --> 00:15:37.833
When everyone else forgot my birthday,

295
00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:41.766
Pumpkaboo was the only one who celebrated with me.

296
00:15:41.833 --> 00:15:45.233
- Kaboo-boo.
- Thank you.

297
00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:47.466
You're so sweet.

298
00:15:47.533 --> 00:15:49.900
Now that I think about it.

299
00:15:49.966 --> 00:15:54.233
Pumpkaboo and I are meant to be together until the end of time.

300
00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.166
- Gour?
- This is a story of love

301
00:15:56.233 --> 00:15:58.266
between a trainer and her Pokémon.

302
00:15:58.333 --> 00:16:00.366
-Geist, geist.

303
00:16:00.433 --> 00:16:02.666
- I'm sorry, Gourgeist.
- Gourgeist.

304
00:16:02.733 --> 00:16:06.366
- I'm sorry for what I said before.
- Gourgeist. Gour.

305
00:16:06.433 --> 00:16:08.866
This is so confusing.

306
00:16:08.933 --> 00:16:10.233
Give it back.

307
00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.466
What good is Gourgeist to you now, anyway?

308
00:16:12.533 --> 00:16:14.633
I suppose so.

309
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.866
Aww!

310
00:16:22.933 --> 00:16:26.200
You're home! So come on out, Gourgeist.

311
00:16:26.266 --> 00:16:29.133
Gourgeist!

312
00:16:29.200 --> 00:16:33.733
- Gourgeist!
- Gour. Gourgeist.

313
00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.300
Ah, I'm sorry.

314
00:16:36.366 --> 00:16:39.866
- Let's stay together forever.
- Gourgeist.

315
00:16:39.933 --> 00:16:43.233
Mm-hm. It doesn't get any better than this, you know?

316
00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:47.400
This is the true bond between Pokémon and trainer.

317
00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:55.200
- Guess all's well that ends well.
- Yes, and ending well ends well for us.

318
00:16:55.266 --> 00:16:59.266
This was simply an issue between the two of them that couldn't be resolved.

319
00:16:59.333 --> 00:17:02.300
Yeah, whatever. We'll be on our way.

320
00:17:02.366 --> 00:17:05.633
Remember, we got a lovely meal, so it was worthwhile.

321
00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.033
- And our bond grew stronger.
- Gourgeist, Gourgeist.

322
00:17:08.099 --> 00:17:09.566
Stop!

323
00:17:09.633 --> 00:17:13.133
- We want Chespin back!
- Chespin?

324
00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.633
- Chespin...

325
00:17:16.866 --> 00:17:20.800
What do you mean? I'll have you know it belongs to us. Huh?

326
00:17:20.866 --> 00:17:23.566
- Kay!
- That's a fake Pikachu!

327
00:17:23.633 --> 00:17:25.866
I know what that means.

328
00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.933
All right, you need to get back.

329
00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:35.766
- Aaah!
- You guys. So it was you after all.

330
00:17:35.833 --> 00:17:38.366
Aaah! I get it. Everything makes sense now.

331
00:17:41.666 --> 00:17:44.333
Prepare for trouble, you aren't so smart!

332
00:17:44.400 --> 00:17:47.033
And make it double, we've made it an art!

333
00:17:47.100 --> 00:17:49.100
To protect the world from devastation!

334
00:17:49.166 --> 00:17:52.133
To unite all people within our nation!

335
00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:54.933
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

336
00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:58.233
To extend our reach to the stars above!

337
00:17:58.300 --> 00:18:00.866
- Jessie!
- And James.

338
00:18:00.933 --> 00:18:03.433
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

339
00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.633
Surrender now or prepare for one confusing fight!

340
00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:10.233
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

341
00:18:11.466 --> 00:18:12.600
-Team Rocket!

342
00:18:12.666 --> 00:18:13.800
Team Rocket?

343
00:18:13.866 --> 00:18:16.133
Bad guys who steal other people's Pokémon!

344
00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:19.100
Bad guys? So they were the real villains after all.

345
00:18:19.166 --> 00:18:21.800
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

346
00:18:21.866 --> 00:18:24.400
Pikachu! Ah, Pika!

347
00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:26.766
Hm!

348
00:18:26.833 --> 00:18:29.033
Heads up, you twerps. Listen and learn.

349
00:18:29.866 --> 00:18:35.000
If you depend on Mega Evolution, your Pokémon will never ever get stronger.

350
00:18:35.066 --> 00:18:36.133
Pay attention.

351
00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:40.033
It's most important to deepen the bond between trainer and Pokémon.

352
00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:41.600
Right?

353
00:18:41.666 --> 00:18:44.133
I fully realise what she said is true.

354
00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.266
But who needs it comin' out of her face?

355
00:18:46.333 --> 00:18:50.833
Having said that, let's deepen our bond with Shadow Ball.

356
00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:51.866
- Dodge it.
- Pika!

357
00:18:51.933 --> 00:18:53.866
All right, time for Leech Seed.

358
00:18:53.933 --> 00:18:55.500
Quick, Pikachu, Iron Tail.

359
00:18:55.566 --> 00:18:57.000
Pika! Pika! Pika!

360
00:18:57.066 --> 00:19:00.066
OK, Inkay, Psybeam, go!

361
00:19:00.133 --> 00:19:02.200
Kay! Inkay!

362
00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:05.966
- Bunnelby, dodge it! Double Slap!
- Bunn! Bunnelby!

363
00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.200
Kay! Kay! Kay...

364
00:19:09.333 --> 00:19:11.133
-Che!

365
00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.800
Chespin! Che!

366
00:19:12.866 --> 00:19:14.266
- Heh.
- Ches, ches, ches, ches!

367
00:19:14.333 --> 00:19:17.900
- Chespin, are you all right?
- Chespin!

368
00:19:17.966 --> 00:19:19.033
That's great.

369
00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:23.266
- No holding back now. Flamethrower, now!
- Braix!

370
00:19:23.333 --> 00:19:25.933
Quick, Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

371
00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:28.966
Pikachu

372
00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:36.966
Blasting off doesn't bother me this time, because my Gourgeist is here with me.

373
00:19:37.033 --> 00:19:38.566
Gourgeist.

374
00:19:38.633 --> 00:19:41.833
- Well, well, isn't that sweet.
- And wholesome.

375
00:19:41.900 --> 00:19:43.533
Wobba.

376
00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:45.666
Outta here!

377
00:19:49.733 --> 00:19:52.900
I do hope all of you will forgive me.

378
00:19:52.966 --> 00:19:55.933
I was tricked, but there's no excuse for it.

379
00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:58.866
- Please let me try to make it up to you.
- Hm?

380
00:19:58.933 --> 00:20:02.500
Well, no prob!

381
00:20:07.666 --> 00:20:10.100
Here you go.

382
00:20:10.166 --> 00:20:13.000
Wow, the soup bowls look just like Gourgeist.

383
00:20:13.066 --> 00:20:15.800
- Looks great!
- Give it a try.

384
00:20:15.866 --> 00:20:17.100
You bet!

385
00:20:17.166 --> 00:20:19.833
'Kay, here goes.

386
00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.600
-Huh?

387
00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:27.600
The Gourgeist Festival always ends with a fireworks display.

388
00:20:27.666 --> 00:20:29.466
Hooray! So pretty!

389
00:20:29.533 --> 00:20:32.600
- Best fireworks ever!
- Pika, pika!

390
00:20:32.666 --> 00:20:35.966
After nearly losing Chespin to Team Rocket,

391
00:20:36.033 --> 00:20:38.833
our heroes are all back together once again.

392
00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:43.033
And, as soon as the Gourgeist Festival and all of its fun is over,

393
00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:45.666
the journey will continue!
